	"data": "The Spatial Computing OS Landscape — Who's Building the Linux of Spatial?\n\nThe Question\n\nThe Steam Frame proved SteamOS runs a full Linux desktop on ARM VR hardware. The Verge reviewer typed his review from inside the headset with six virtual monitors. That wasn't a gaming use case — that was spatial computing. The question: is SteamOS becoming the open spatial computing OS, or is it just a gaming headset that happens to run a desktop? And what else is out there?\n\nThe Landscape — Five Layers of…",
